    "created_at": "2020-02-12T00:49:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-02-12T00:54:37Z",
    "body": "Getting the config from the `gcloud` config files may be faster than running the `gcloud` cli. (The files are already in `toml` format. :1st_place_medal: )\r\n\r\nGetting the active config name: `~/.config/gcloud/active_config`\r\n```\r\n❯ cat ~/.config/gcloud/active_config\r\ndefault⏎\r\n```\r\n\r\nGetting a config by name: `~/.config/gcloud/configurations/config_{CONFIG NAME}`\r\n```\r\n❯ cat ~/.config/gcloud/configurations/config_default \r\n[core]\r\naccount = {EMAIL HERE}\r\nproject = {PROJECT NAME HERE}\r\n\r\n[compute]\r\nzone = us-east1-b\r\n```",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
