    "body": "Not sure if this should be captured separately, but I would like the **version number** of the current `gcloud cli` printed. I believe this would require a call to the `gcloud cli` to be compatible with tools like [`asdf`](https://asdf-vm.com) which detect the specific version based on a config file.\r\n\r\n- See [asdf-gcloud](https://github.com/jthegedus/asdf-gcloud)",
